                    coach_intro:            `Two voices will challenge you all the way: the field-rep council, whose members hold the customer relationships and earn 55% of their variable pay as reorder commission, and a CFO who approved £4.5M and will ask what it bought. Neither of them works for the other. Tell me what you think this problem is before you tell me what you will buy.`,

